      "writtenOn": "2013-11-22T03:34:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m proposing we move DISCONNECT_CAUSE_* to a new class  android.telephony.DisconnectCause -- more natural when the same disc codes are used elsewhere, e.g. in call log.",
      "revId": "363ba26d67734701f5017109913b2053a408eb99",
